    "detailed_description": "<strong>This is an IDLE game where your goal is to build an Empire.</strong><br><br>In this game you will be harvesting resources, upgrading your buildings,<br>waging war, and prestiging, Most mechanics in-game are automated.<br>You won`t need to be active while playing it.<br><br>This is a free game, and I will be fixing and maintaining it in the begining<br>until I feel like the game is ready!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Questions?</h2><br>Is this game endless?<br>Answer: No! you will eventually reach max variable value.<br><br>Why is this game free?<br>Answer: Sometimes I will be making free games as way of increasing my community and fanbase!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1509950/extras/01085313b37b17e5ef737ac4ae052aaf.webp?t=1751658710\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 Resources to be harvested and used.<br></li><li>Buildings Upgrades.<br></li><li> War idle-mechanics<br></li><li>Prestige System<br></li><li>Workers upgrades<br></li><li>Charming art++</li></ul>",
